rate, and verify the existence of, quantum superpositions oftwo or more states which are by some reasonable criterion`macroscopically' distinct, and show that various a prioriobjections to this programme made in the literature are flawed. Ireview the extent to which such experiments currently exist inthe areas of free-space molecular diffraction, magneticbiomolecules, quantum optics and Josephson devices, and sketchpossible future lines of development of the programme.", "abstract_source_suggest": {"input": "IOP"}}], "refereed": true, "titles": [{"source": "IOP", "title": "Testing the limits of quantum mechanics: motivation, state of play, prospects"}], "facet_author_name": ["1019446_Anthony James Leggett"], "core": false, "imprints": [{"date": "2002-04-04"}], "_oai": {"sets": ["Literature"], "id": "oai:inspirehep.net:2794021", "updated": "2026-02-09T14:00:49.180865"}, "curated": false, "journal_title_variants": ["J. Phys. Condens. Matter", "J.Phys.Condens.Matter"]}, "updated": "2026-02-09T14:00:49.180865+00:00", "created": "2024-06-04T10:43:12.078276+00:00"}], "total": 1}, "links": {"self": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1088%2F0953-8984%2F14%2F15%2F201&size=5&page=1", "bibtex": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1088%2F0953-8984%2F14%2F15%2F201&size=5&page=1&format=bibtex", "latex-eu": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1088%2F0953-8984%2F14%2F15%2F201&size=5&page=1&format=latex-eu", "latex-us": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1088%2F0953-8984%2F14%2F15%2F201&size=5&page=1&format=latex-us", "json": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1088%2F0953-8984%2F14%2F15%2F201&size=5&page=1&format=json", "json-expanded": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1088%2F0953-8984%2F14%2F15%2F201&size=5&page=1&format=json-expanded", "cv": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1088%2F0953-8984%2F14%2F15%2F201&size=5&page=1&format=cv"}}